;; own base-menu-state-52 :code. find-first-selectable is extern-declared
;; only (decompiler/config/jakx/all-types.gc:68717) with no defun anywhere
;; in goal_src - the only body is dead menu2.gc:12497-12648, itself carrying
;; three real decode errors and out of this slice's scope. Landing this
;; install as specified would add a new check_extern_defun caller of an
;; extern-no-defun symbol, which this rung's own gate battery must show as
;; zero delta against baseline; holding it here keeps that true. Retirement
;; condition: find-first-selectable lands a real body (its own rung; not
;; touched here).

;; base-menu slot 59 re-install: issue 759, a2 rung's own STEP 5, the a1
;; idiom (menu2-installs.gc:994-996) applied to the one slot this rung
;; fills. Section E's own vtable-snapshot hazard: menu2-h.o's deftype forms
;; run before base-menu's own real method-59 exists, so any subtype that
;; never gets its own method-59 override keeps the stale (nullptr) copy it
;; snapshotted at deftype time, and base-menu-init-by-other calls method 59
;; unconditionally on every spawned widget (menu2-installs.gc:871).
;;
;; jakx-logo-menu is the only type on this rung's own list (selection-
;; menu-manager, dropdown-item, jakx-logo-menu) that actually needs the
;; re-install: selection-menu-manager already carries its own real
;; base-menu-method-59 (menu2-installs.gc:605, landed by a1) and
;; dropdown-item now carries its own real base-menu-method-59 (landed
;; above, this same file) - both write their own vtable slot 59 directly
;; via their own defmethod's method-set!, so re-installing base-menu's
;; generic stub over either here would silently replace the real body just
